{{PAGENAME}} is a high-tier piece of chest [[:Category:Armor|armor]] made from [[Hardened Leather|Hardened Leather]] and [[Mammoth Hide]] and [[Mammoth Tusk]]. It equips to the [[Equipment Screen|equipment slot]] 4R.

==Quality Formula==

The quality formula is <math>\frac{_{q}Hardened Leather + _{q}Hide + _{q}Tusk}{3}</math> [[softcap]]ped by <math>\sqrt{Sewing * Dexterity}</math>.

